    <h2>Support and your choices</h2>
    <p>If you contact us by email, we receive the address and information you choose to send and use it to respond to your request. Do not send private inventory or backups unless needed and intentionally shared. You can request deletion of support correspondence by contacting us; records may be retained where needed for legal obligations or resolving a dispute. We cannot recover inventory we do not hold or delete copies held by your chosen providers on your behalf.</p>
    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>The app uses Android application-private storage and system camera, photo and document mechanisms. Private storage provides access control; the app does not add a separate encryption layer to inventory files or ZIP backups. Google and your selected providers have their own security practices. No software or storage method guarantees absolute security.</p>
    <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
    <p>This is a general personal-organization tool, not a service specifically directed to children. We do not knowingly collect children’s personal information through an app account or inventory server. If you have a concern about information sent to us, contact us using the address above.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as features or integrations change. The effective date appears above. For privacy questions or requests concerning information you have sent to us, email <a href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">velvetandpixel@gmail.com</a>.</p>
